#### Data Segmentation and Mode Identification:                                 
By analyzing the trajectories from the three provided files, the system state $X
= [x_1, x_2]^T$ evolves in discrete time steps. Transitions between modes are   
clearly visible as discontinuities in the derivative of the state or changes in 
the regression residuals.                                                       
