│ $x_1$ phase lag and $x_2$ divergence.\n2.  **$x_2$ Dynamics:** In Mode 1,    │
│ $\\dot{x}_2 = 0.2$ is insufficient. Ground truth $x_2$ exhibits coupled      │
│ growth and frequent resets that the simulation misses entirely because $x_2$ │
│ never reaches the $1.0$ threshold.\n3.  **Damping/Gain Errors:** $x_1$ in    │
│ the simulation decays slower than the ground truth, suggesting the           │
│ coefficients for $x_1$ and $u_1$ in the ODEs are poorly calibrated."         │
